{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102153146911-1102_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261102154948\"/><p>王文濤（圖）將偕王毅主持APEC雙部長視像會議。</p><p>外交部發言人周一（2日）宣布，中共中央政治局委員、外交部長王毅與商務部長王文濤將於周二（3日）在北京，共同主持亞太經合組織（APEC）第37屆外交和貿易雙部長視像會議。</p><p>外交部發言人另宣布，王毅將於周二至周三（4日）在北京主持瀾滄江—湄公河合作第十一次外長會。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:47.300380+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:31:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:44.636353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:58:20.852756+00:00","content_hash":"e1088fbdac1b2111e7ff83f22894307e78247ba59de650c466e87b7ac7ccdea4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}